# HMPPS Manage Offences API

###
# @name Get the severity rating for each of the passed in offence codes
# URL encoded comma delimited list of offence codes to look up
@offenceCodes = CL67011%2CRR84216%2CRT88136
GET {{manage_offences_base_url}}//offences/severity-ratings?offenceCodes={{offenceCodes}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("Manage Offences API")}}
Accept: application/json

